<title>BAHRAIN: Small fire at Bahrain luxury hotel.</title>
<headline>Small fire at Bahrain luxury hotel.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A power generator blew up at a luxury hotel in the Bahraini capital Manama on Saturday, causing a fire, a government official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The fire at the Diplomat Hotel was caused by an electricity generator explosion,&quot; the official told Reuters. &quot;The blaze occured on the 14th floor, but there were no casualties or damage.&quot;</p>
<p>One firefighter at the 14-storey hotel said: &quot;The fire was small but the smoke was thick.&quot;</p>
